    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, one-bathroom ground floor own-door apartment to the Dublin 10 property market. Ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Cedar Brook development in Park West, No. 37 offers c. 64 sqm of bright, well-proportioned living space. Boasting a highly desirable BER B energy rating and presented in turnkey condition throughout, this property represents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a low-maintenance home in a convenient location.\nThe location is exceptional. Cedar Brook benefits from unrivalled connectivity, situated just a short stroll from Park West & Cherry Orchard Train Station, offering direct rail links into Grand Canal Dock and Heuston Station in minutes. The area is served by extensive bus routes, while the M50 motorway, N7, and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre are all easily accessible by car. Local amenities, sports facilities, and shops are all within easy reach.\nBright, spacious, and efficiently laid out, the c. 64 sqm internal accommodation is accessed via its own private front door. The property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading into a light-filled open-plan lounge and dining area with a fully fitted modern kitchen, two generous double bedrooms, a main family bathroom suite, and a master bedroom complete with a walk in wardrobe. A standout feature of No. 37 is the private, sunny west-facing rear garden, catching optimal afternoon and evening sunlight to provide a wonderful outdoor space to unwind.\nViewing is highly advised, call RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today for further information or to arrange a viewing!\nAdditional Features;\n•c. 64 sqm\n•BER B\n•2 BED / 1 BATH\n•Ground floor own-door apartment\n•Private sunny west-facing rear garden\n•Bright open-plan lounge/dining & fully fitted kitchen area\n•Generous double bedrooms with fitted storage\n•Main family bathroom suite\n•Designated car space\n•Minutes on foot to Park West & Cherry Orchard Train Station\n•Short drive to Liffey Valley Shopping Centre, M50 & N7\n•Direct rail & bus transport options into Dublin City Centre\n•Ideal for First-Time Buyers, Downsizers, and Investors alike\nDirections\nFrom the Red Cow Roundabout, proceed onto the Naas Road heading inbound toward Dublin City Centre. Turn left at the major junction onto Kylemore Road and follow straight towards Park West. Take the exit towards Park West Avenue and proceed straight, passing the Park West Train Station on your left. Turn right onto Cedar Brook Way, and No. 37 will be located on your right-hand side.\n"
      },
      {
